{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":65,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝對悖逆者的懲罰"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"素來沒有訪問我的，現在求問我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有尋找我的，我叫他們遇見；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有稱為我名下的，我對他們說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在這裏！我在這裏！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我整天伸手招呼那悖逆的百姓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們隨自己的意念行不善之道。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這百姓時常當面惹我發怒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在園中獻祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在壇","poem":1},{"noteId":76},{"text":"上燒香；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在墳墓間坐着，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在隱密處住宿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃豬肉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們器皿中有可憎之物做的湯；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且對人說：你站開吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要挨近我，因為我比你聖潔。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主說：這些人是我鼻中的煙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是整天燒着的火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，這都寫在我面前。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不靜默，必施行報應，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必將你們的罪孽和你們列祖的罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是在山上燒香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在岡上褻瀆我的罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同報應在他們後人懷中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我先要把他們所行的量給他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和華如此說：葡萄中尋得新酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人就說：不要毀壞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為福在其中。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因我僕人的緣故也必照樣而行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不將他們全然毀滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"我必從雅各中領出後裔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從猶大中領出承受我眾山的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的選民必承受；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的僕人要在那裏居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙崙平原必成為羊群的圈；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞割谷必成為牛群躺臥之處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都為尋求我的民所得。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你們這些離棄耶和華、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘記我的聖山、給時運擺筵席","poem":1},{"noteId":77},{"text":"、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給天命盛滿調和酒的，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要命定你們歸在刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都必屈身被殺；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我呼喚，你們沒有答應；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說話，你們沒有聽從；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"反倒行我眼中看為惡的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"揀選我所不喜悅的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"所以，主耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的僕人必得吃，你們卻飢餓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的僕人必得喝，你們卻乾渴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的僕人必歡喜，你們卻蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的僕人因心中高興歡呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們卻因心中憂愁哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又因心裏憂傷哀號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必留下自己的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為我選民指着賭咒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華必殺你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"另起別名稱呼他的僕人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，在地上為自己求福的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必憑真實的上帝求福；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在地上起誓的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必指真實的上帝起誓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，從前的患難已經忘記，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也從我眼前隱藏了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["新天新地"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"看哪！我造新天新地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從前的事不再被記念，也不再追想。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們當因我所造的永遠歡喜快樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我造耶路撒冷為人所喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"造其中的居民為人所樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必因耶路撒冷歡喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我的百姓快樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中必不再聽見哭泣的聲音和哀號的聲音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中必沒有數日夭亡的嬰孩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有壽數不滿的老者；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為百歲死的仍算孩童，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有百歲死的罪人算被咒詛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要建造房屋，自己居住；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽種葡萄園，吃其中的果子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們建造的，別人不得住；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們栽種的，別人不得吃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我民的日子必像樹木的日子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我選民親手勞碌得來的必長久享用。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必不徒然勞碌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所生產的，也不遭災害，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為都是蒙耶和華賜福的後裔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的子孫也是如此。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們尚未求告，我就應允；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正說話的時候，我就垂聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豺狼必與羊羔同食；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"獅子必吃草與牛一樣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"塵土必作蛇的食物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我聖山的遍處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這一切都不傷人，不害物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":76,"caller":"-","text":"原文是磚","reference":{"chapter":65,"verse":3}},{"noteId":77,"caller":"-","text":"原文是桌子","reference":{"chapter":65,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/65.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/64.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}